{"3884970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Layer Land", "steam_appid": 3884970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/cc112be24c9d31d97e0ff21ad495e67e.avif?t=1785479679\" width=616 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Inhabitants of Layerland</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>In Layerland, you can encounter a variety of pets and monsters. Each pet has a different appearance, attributes, and combat style, along with a unique personality and traits based on MBTI. Explore new regions and meet your very own adventure partner.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/7c4d2b110eca7a5fde21771a36eaaca8.poster.avif?t=1785479679\" width=876 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/7c4d2b110eca7a5fde21771a36eaaca8.webm?t=1785479679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/7c4d2b110eca7a5fde21771a36eaaca8.mp4?t=1785479679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Exploring Diverse Biomes</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You can explore regions with different environments such as forests, deserts, volcanoes, and snowfields. Each biome features a unique atmosphere, terrain, and monsters, and players will pioneer new regions through preparation and strategies tailored to each environment.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/8c6c66fc39d019e63a0b3b0a2fd9275b.poster.avif?t=1785479679\" width=1120 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/8c6c66fc39d019e63a0b3b0a2fd9275b.webm?t=1785479679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/8c6c66fc39d019e63a0b3b0a2fd9275b.mp4?t=1785479679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Gathering and Crafting</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Gather resources and craft equipment and items. Using materials acquired during exploration, you can create equipment necessary for survival and various crafted goods.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/7524d1803e6f3b4a27c5217a3494aad1.poster.avif?t=1785479679\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/7524d1803e6f3b4a27c5217a3494aad1.webm?t=1785479679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/7524d1803e6f3b4a27c5217a3494aad1.mp4?t=1785479679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free Base Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utilize collected resources to build your own base. You can place structures, organize the space, and develop the base that will serve as the foundation for your explorations.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/75df3f1d7fffe1e8951cb7aab2804eb0.poster.avif?t=1785479679\" width=1152 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/75df3f1d7fffe1e8951cb7aab2804eb0.webm?t=1785479679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/75df3f1d7fffe1e8951cb7aab2804eb0.mp4?t=1785479679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful boss monsters exist in each region. The boss embodies the atmosphere and characteristics of the region, and becomes the main objective of the exploration through exclusive skills and combat sequences.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/f8dc3bb0cf7d8a569fb8c56fff59cda6.poster.avif?t=1785479679\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/f8dc3bb0cf7d8a569fb8c56fff59cda6.webm?t=1785479679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/f8dc3bb0cf7d8a569fb8c56fff59cda6.mp4?t=1785479679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>AI Pets, Unpredictable Behaviors</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The pets in Layerland don't just stop at responding to command buttons; they react to players' real-time conversations and show different reactions depending on their personalities.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Until you tame a wild monster as a pet, no one can predict its personality.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/0a42b7b0c64ff17d37ab011092f9202c.poster.avif?t=1785479679\" width=850 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/0a42b7b0c64ff17d37ab011092f9202c.webm?t=1785479679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/0a42b7b0c64ff17d37ab011092f9202c.mp4?t=1785479679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Reality-Based Terrain World</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Experience an unimaginable scale realized by precisely processing vast terrain data of the actual Earth.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The massive mountain ranges, endless oceans, and real city borders of our reality combine with the civilization of a fantasy world to be reborn as a completely new stage for adventure.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/bb6db3d0c70f94949d6849b0dee5ebc8.poster.avif?t=1785479679\" width=1104 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/bb6db3d0c70f94949d6849b0dee5ebc8.webm?t=1785479679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/bb6db3d0c70f94949d6849b0dee5ebc8.mp4?t=1785479679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/cc112be24c9d31d97e0ff21ad495e67e.avif?t=1785479679\" width=616 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Inhabitants of Layerland</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>In Layerland, you can encounter a variety of pets and monsters. Each pet has a different appearance, attributes, and combat style, along with a unique personality and traits based on MBTI. Explore new regions and meet your very own adventure partner.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/7c4d2b110eca7a5fde21771a36eaaca8.poster.avif?t=1785479679\" width=876 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/7c4d2b110eca7a5fde21771a36eaaca8.webm?t=1785479679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/7c4d2b110eca7a5fde21771a36eaaca8.mp4?t=1785479679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Exploring Diverse Biomes</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You can explore regions with different environments such as forests, deserts, volcanoes, and snowfields. Each biome features a unique atmosphere, terrain, and monsters, and players will pioneer new regions through preparation and strategies tailored to each environment.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/8c6c66fc39d019e63a0b3b0a2fd9275b.poster.avif?t=1785479679\" width=1120 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/8c6c66fc39d019e63a0b3b0a2fd9275b.webm?t=1785479679\" type=\"video/w